":175,"line":173},"type":69,"typeText":"∀ {X : Type u} [inst : TopologicalSpace.{u} X] (x : X) (P : Set.{u} X → Prop),\n  (∀ (s t : Set.{u} X), HasSubset.Subset.{u} s t → P s → P t) →\n    Iff (∀ (s : Set.{u} X), Membership.mem.{u, u} (nhds.{u} x) s → P s)\n      (∀ (s : Set.{u} X), IsOpen.{u} s → Membership.mem.{u, u} s x → P s)","unsafe":false,"value":225,"source":{"code":"theorem all_mem_nhds (x : X) (P : Set X → Prop) (hP : ∀ s t, s ⊆ t → P s → P t) :\n    (∀ s ∈ 𝓝 x, P s) ↔ ∀ s, IsOpen s → x ∈ s → P s :=\n  ((nhds_basis_opens x).forall_iff hP).trans <| by simp only [@and_comm (x ∈ _), and_imp]","start":173,"end":175},"axioms":["Quot.sound","propext"]}